0040 s¶¬¬    -- THERE ARE TWO INTERPRETATIONS WITH SAME RESULT TYPE¶¬¬    -- CHECK FOR COMPATIBILITY OF IMPLICIT CONVERSIONS¶¶      TYPE_SPEC¬: constant TR
